        "steam_appid": 4086070,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086070/extras/e060acbafe34693cb660387c8f4c0233.avif?t=1768448566\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toledo Park Quest </strong>is an engaging and educational 2D platformer where players become young guardians on a mission to restore and protect the parks of Toledo. Developed in partnership with the City of Toledo’s Department of Parks &amp; Youth Services and BESN X Community, the game combines exploration, environmental awareness, and light puzzle-solving in a fun, story-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore real-world inspired locations like Ottawa Park and the Police Museum, collecting trash, repairing landmarks, and uncovering clues to stop the mysterious forces damaging the parks. Each level introduces new challenges and mini-games that teach the importance of community care, sustainability, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳 <strong>Explore Toledo’s Parks:</strong> Traverse beautifully illustrated 2D environments inspired by real locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 <strong>Clean and Restore:</strong> Collect litter, fix objects, and bring nature back to life through interactive missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♀️ <strong>Solve Mysteries:</strong> Follow clues to uncover who or what is harming the parks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Accessible Gameplay:</strong> Simple controls and educational storytelling designed for players of all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Learn &amp; Grow:</strong> Earn achievements while discovering fun facts about local history and the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the guardians, protect Toledo’s parks, and make your community shine again!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086070/extras/e060acbafe34693cb660387c8f4c0233.avif?t=1768448566\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toledo Park Quest </strong>is an engaging and educational 2D platformer where players become young guardians on a mission to restore and protect the parks of Toledo. Developed in partnership with the City of Toledo’s Department of Parks &amp; Youth Services and BESN X Community, the game combines exploration, environmental awareness, and light puzzle-solving in a fun, story-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore real-world inspired locations like Ottawa Park and the Police Museum, collecting trash, repairing landmarks, and uncovering clues to stop the mysterious forces damaging the parks. Each level introduces new challenges and mini-games that teach the importance of community care, sustainability, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳 <strong>Explore Toledo’s Parks:</strong> Traverse beautifully illustrated 2D environments inspired by real locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 <strong>Clean and Restore:</strong> Collect litter, fix objects, and bring nature back to life through interactive missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♀️ <strong>Solve Mysteries:</strong> Follow clues to uncover who or what is harming the parks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Accessible Gameplay:</strong> Simple controls and educational storytelling designed for players of all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Learn &amp; Grow:</strong> Earn achievements while discovering fun facts about local history and the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the guardians, protect Toledo’s parks, and make your community shine again!</p>",
